      "content": "thanks. it doesn't really feel that bad though, just a bit annoying and uncomfortable. i'm pretty sure i just ate something that didn't agree with me. if i take a couple of ibuprofen and maybe some antacids, is there anything else i should keep an eye on that would actually be a concern? i'm really trying to avoid an expensive ER visit if i can help it.",
